{"id":"jofpq921ampjxjmro031mts2m","title":"PyPI 实施更严格的软件包上传检查机制","originalTitle":"Stricter checks for uploaded distributions on PyPI","summary":"PyPI 宣布将实施更严格的软件包上传检查机制，以减少解析差异和提升安全性。当前已禁止 V7-style tar 归档和包含 ZIP 控制结构的评论，后续计划全面禁止 GNU 风格 tar 和 ZIP 评论。","reason":"PyPI 通过限制非标准 tar 和 ZIP 格式来减少解析差异，提升软件包分发安全性，维护者需确保使用合规的构建工具。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://blog.pypi.org/posts/2026-11-18-stricter-checks-for-uploaded-sdists/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T20:00:42.222Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T22:34:37.053Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T22:34:37.053Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["版本发布","许可证变更"],"score":80,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c1ae8560-f6d8-4792-8d7c-9e6b7d02d746","title":"PyPI实施分发包格式检查新规"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c1ae8560-f6d8-4792-8d7c-9e6b7d02d746","title":"PyPI实施分发包格式检查新规"}],"topics":[{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"license-change","name":"许可证与治理"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fvWK1BILOXIs","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}